# VESC Configuration Secrets
#
# INSTRUCTIONS:
# 1. Copy this file: cp .secrets.example .secrets
# 2. Replace placeholders below with your actual passwords
# 3. Protect the file: chmod 600 .secrets
# 4. NEVER commit .secrets to git (it's in .gitignore)
#
# IMPORTANT: Line numbers matter!
# - Only non-empty, non-comment lines are counted
# - Line 1 = REDACTED-LINE-1, Line 2 = REDACTED-LINE-2, etc.
# - Empty lines and lines starting with # are ignored
#
# Format: One secret per line

# Line 1: WiFi Station/AP Password (wifi_sta_key, wifi_ap_key)
YOUR_WIFI_PASSWORD_HERE

# Line 2: TCP Hub Password (tcp_hub_pass)
YOUR_TCP_HUB_PASSWORD_HERE

# Line 3: BLE PIN (ble_pin) - typically 6 digits
123456

# Add more secrets below as needed
# Each new line becomes REDACTED-LINE-N where N is the line number
